MemMan 2.42 binary redistribution notice

This directory contains Base64-encoded copies of MEMMAN.COM, TL.COM, and TK.COM
from the MemMan 2.42 package distributed at:

https://msxhub.com/MEMMAN/2.4-2

According to the MemMan 2.42 specification included with that package, these
three programs are Public Domain.

LT.COM and the TSRFRAME files are not Public Domain and are intentionally not
included here.

The Base64 representation keeps the original binary assets in a
text-reviewable form. SHA256SUMS records the hashes of those decoded upstream
.COM files. During materialization, this project verifies the complete MemMan
2.42 configuration structure at file offset 0x01B8 and changes only its
little-endian heap-size word at offset 0x01BB, from 0x0080 to 0x0500 bytes. The
committed Base64 asset and its upstream checksum remain unchanged.
